label wardrobeIsClosed
[REPLACE] I pull the handle of the cabinet and feel something pressing from the outside
[REPLACE] The pressure increases and I release the handle in fear
[signal arg="Bathroom_ClothesFallsOut"]
[REPLACE] The door opens and a pile of clothes falls out of the closet
[end_timeline]
label wardrobeIsOpened
[REPLACE] There is nothing else in the cabinet
[end_timeline]